        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 24 at 11:56PM MDT until September 25 at 12:00AM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>The Flash Flood Warning has been replaced by an Areal Flood Warning
which is in effect until 330 AM MDT. Please refer to that bulletin
for the latest information.

